{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18398","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 范传正","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暧暧当迟日，微微扇好风。\n吹摇新叶上，光动浅花中。\n澹荡凝清昼，氤氲暧碧空。\n稍看生绿水，已觉散芳丛。\n徙倚情偏适，裴回赏未穷。\n妍华不可状，竟夕气融融。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"范传正","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}